  <!--EN: These people have been here a very long time. Their civilization started as a gathering of tribes, but quickly developed skills such as writing, masonry and civil service. \n\nDespite their apparent technological weakness, the Republic can be dangerous enemies and valuable friends because of their skill with low-tech warfare, their numbers, and their hardiness.\n\nThis particular part of the Republic holds production and city development in high regards. Gaining their support will unlock several perks focused on improving the wellbeing of the people.-->
  <VFEC_CentralRepublic.description>这些人已经在这里呆了很长时间了。他们的文明始于部落的聚集，但很快就发展出了写作、石工和公务员等技能。 

尽管共和国存在明显的技术弱点，但由于其低技术战争技能、数量和坚韧，它们可以成为危险的敌人和宝贵的朋友。

共和国的这个特殊部分高度重视生产和城市发展。获得他们的支持将带来多项旨在改善人民福祉的福利。</VFEC_CentralRepublic.description>
  <!--EN: central republic-->
  <VFEC_CentralRepublic.label>中央共和国</VFEC_CentralRepublic.label>
  <!--EN: These people have been here a very long time. Their civilization started as a gathering of tribes, but quickly developed skills such as writing, masonry and civil service. \n\nDespite their apparent technological weakness, the Imperium can be dangerous enemies and valuable friends because of their skill with low-tech warfare, their numbers, and their hardiness.\n\nThis particular part of the Republic values hard work and production over brawl and intellect. Gaining their support will unlock several perks focused on research and progress.-->
  <VFEC_EasternRepublic.description>这些人已经在这里呆了很长时间了。他们的文明始于部落的聚集，但很快就发展出了写作、石工和公务员等技能。 

尽管帝国在技术上存在明显的弱点，但由于他们在低技术战争方面的技巧、他们的数量和坚韧，他们可以成为危险的敌人和宝贵的朋友。

共和国的这个特殊部分重视努力工作和生产，而不是争吵和智力。获得他们的支持将释放一些专注于研究和进步的福利。</VFEC_EasternRepublic.description>
